{
  "slug": "management-consulting",
  "name": "Management Consulting",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full consulting engagement lifecycle. Strategy, financial modeling, proposals, pricing, due diligence, implementation, change management, governance, deliverables, closeout. Asks for your data before building anything.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `change-management` (Design and execute organizational change management programs), `client-deliverables` (Create consulting-grade client deliverables (written reports and executive presentations)), `due-diligence` (Conduct commercial, operational, financial, strategic, and technology due diligence for M&A, investment, partnership, or vendor decisions), `engagement-pricing` (Develop consulting pricing models and commercial strategy for engagements), `engagement-setup` (Guide the first weeks of a consulting engagement from contract signature through a running project), `financial-modeling` (Build financial models for business cases including ROI, NPV, IRR, scenario analysis, and total cost of ownership), `implementation-planning` (Bridge strategy to execution through structured option development, business case construction, roadmap design, and implementation planning), `org-design` (Design organizational structures, operating models, and role frameworks), and 8 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install management-consulting@claude-community` from `anotb/management-consulting-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
